                "comment": "she was cool but the 1 credit course was way more work than a 1 credit course should be. She is pretty funny and really nice.",
                "difficulty_rating": 5,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "A one credit course that was lightly graded. Weekly summaries of short readings, guest speakers, and even panelists on different biological issues. Interesting class. Because of the weekly guest speakers, it's hard to really say much about the professor.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Class was EXTREMELY interesting and she is very interested in the material. Know that this is mainly a graduate student class and, although it is a relaxed environment, the amount of work you are expected to do is not fully explained. 2 credit class that requires as much work as a 4 credit class. Fun and interesting but too much work for 2 credits",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 4
